{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/d89e934b4c4a1560eb8643c06ddbfb93.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>***DRIVE A LAWN MOWER FOR REWARDS IN THE NEW UPDATE***</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/8952f02db7788d42ac25a386324d11e2.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/8952f02db7788d42ac25a386324d11e2.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/8952f02db7788d42ac25a386324d11e2.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Amazing Frog? is an openworld, sandbox, GTA style version of Swindon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Use bonkers physics to throw ridiculous, farting ragdoll frogs all around town and beyond the city walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore Swindonshire and unlock new worlds, skins, weapons, vehicles and challenges in the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Quest for the Magical Mystery Toilet!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a7122b67ad90c4ef376ca9c8f7ceb10f.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a7122b67ad90c4ef376ca9c8f7ceb10f.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a7122b67ad90c4ef376ca9c8f7ceb10f.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/627ac9eec4f75d551dad7e8290dfa9a7.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start the fun in single player or play up to 4 player split-screen with your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play co-op or combat or just do your own thing - its up to you!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/d383d9d31cfdc98252b634f45ac7336d.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/d383d9d31cfdc98252b634f45ac7336d.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/d383d9d31cfdc98252b634f45ac7336d.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/2c6e8e991983f75ff20881c6c61b8254.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Its a <strong>Big Big world</strong> out there, with lots to discover, you can even explore the moon. Watch out for any dangerous creatures! Also this is a little reminder that not all frogs want to be your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/853781a4357c483ceaf36cf2955d4e34.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/853781a4357c483ceaf36cf2955d4e34.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/853781a4357c483ceaf36cf2955d4e34.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/62b97cae0506ab435a6c4040baa0a79d.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It doesnt hurt to get very rich, so load up the Bank of Swindon. Also, you never know what we might add next and what items may come in handy. So, collect everything from berries and other produce, zombie flesh, jam jars, money, skulls, fish or dead pigeons ...EVERYTHING! (\u2026 there are so many items you can put in your inventory) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don\u2019t forget to use a vacuum for faster bulk collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/678a732ba3ddb30e1cd46e71b2e6c01c.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/678a732ba3ddb30e1cd46e71b2e6c01c.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/678a732ba3ddb30e1cd46e71b2e6c01c.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a90332c9f3ca56906e294bf128d48ed3.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will find there are lots of ways to earn money in Swindonshire! You can also try driving a Taxi or Collecting trash on '<strong>Bin Day</strong>'. Look out for other Jobs around Swindon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/78c943951a6b5d6b94f8df5602138d82.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/78c943951a6b5d6b94f8df5602138d82.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/78c943951a6b5d6b94f8df5602138d82.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/0c97fee1b1ce86e22b7ac7f2a1d665ca.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If it fits, it can flush!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Try Flushing everything to discover the transformative effects of the Magical Mystery Toilet. Repeat flushes can intensify the magic ( just like in real life ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/43be630e81f45f2f1c8005a7fb84acc5.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/43be630e81f45f2f1c8005a7fb84acc5.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/43be630e81f45f2f1c8005a7fb84acc5.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/3fe323f3defa974cccc7af97f225692a.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/12cd4cca411982de9c3bca710b6c7d24.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/12cd4cca411982de9c3bca710b6c7d24.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/12cd4cca411982de9c3bca710b6c7d24.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/332570?t=1766234722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/0d660d01bed74a1b1785653eca8de1cefe2e2a1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766234722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/322913fd7d58d780bb52f2fefd4917de72191c32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766234722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/322913fd7d