s you can put in your inventory) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don\u2019t forget to use a vacuum for faster bulk collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/678a732ba3ddb30e1cd46e71b2e6c01c.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/678a732ba3ddb30e1cd46e71b2e6c01c.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/678a732ba3ddb30e1cd46e71b2e6c01c.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a90332c9f3ca56906e294bf128d48ed3.webp?t=1766234722\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will find there are lots of ways to earn money in Swindonshire! You can also try driving a Taxi or Collecting trash on '<strong>Bin Day</strong>'. Look out for other Jobs around Swindon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/78c943951a6b5d6b94f8df5602138d82.poster.avif?t=1766234722\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/78c943951a6b5d6b94f8df5602138d82.webm?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/78c943951a6b5d6b94f8df5602138d82.mp4?t=1766234722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c